<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47041" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sur-rādo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subr-</span></b> ), si, sum, 3, v.
		a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>to scrape below.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b> (ante- and postclass.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ficos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 50</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arborem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. Apr. 4</span></i>
			.— * </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, of a river, <i>to run
				close under</i>, <i>to flow along</i> or <i>past</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">barbaros fines,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 28, 2, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
